# LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree. Overrides the
# global core.autocrlf=true of this Windows machine, whose CRLF checkout would
# otherwise show up as a whole-file diff and defeat the nginx image build,
# which runs on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The two Windows shells that genuinely need CRLF: cmd.exe mis-parses a `goto`
# past a lone LF. PowerShell does not care, but keeping the pair together
# avoids having to remember which one is which.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
